\caption{Reliability diagrams on SciERC ($N{=}8$, $T{=}1.0$). Top: mean F1 vs.\ binned confidence; bottom: instance counts per bin. Left: NER; right: RE. SJ and Voting are well-calibrated on NER (ECE$\,{=}\,$0.077, 0.071); logprob shows higher calibration error (0.113). On RE, calibration degrades for all signals, with logprob reaching ECE$\,{=}\,$0.380.}
\label{fig:reliability}
